        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/858c86/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-25T17:56:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just played a game with Wraith against Omnitron.&nbsp; Omnitron was under the effect of a Stun Bolt and he played Technological Singularity which destroyed 5 of Wraith's equipment cards.&nbsp; Now does she take 9 damage or 5?&nbsp;</p><p>9 = (2 lightning damage x 5 equipment cards) - 1 for Stun Bolt</p><p>5 = (2 lightning damage - 1 for Stun Bolt) x 5 equipment cards</p><p>I played that it was 5 separate instances of 2 damage a pop so that she took 5 altogether, but then again, I always feel like I'm doing SOMETHING wrong LOL.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:46.425Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
