        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I just played a game with Wraith against Omnitron.&nbsp; Omnitron was under the effect of a Stun Bolt and he played Technological Singularity which destroyed 5 of Wraith&#39;s equipment cards.&nbsp; Now does she take 9 damage or 5?&nbsp;</p><p>9 = (2 lightning damage x 5 equipment cards) - 1 for Stun Bolt</p><p>5 = (2 lightning damage - 1 for Stun Bolt) x 5 equipment cards</p><p>I played that it was 5 separate instances of 2 damage a pop so that she took 5 altogether, but then again, I always feel like I&#39;m doing SOMETHING wrong LOL.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
