        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It&#39;s 5 lots of 2, you can compare this wording to the wording on Haka&#39;s <em>Savage Mana</em> for comparision of how a single lot of damage is worded... or indeed Wraith&#39;s <em>Inventory Barrage.</em></p><p>Just to complicate matters further it should be mentioned that if Wraith had used her Stealth power then she would block the first point of damage with that and then take 4 further lots of 1 damage from the attack, as each lot of damage done is considered a separate attack</p>",
